---
description: "Load canonical repository policy and task-specific guides"
alwaysApply: true
---

Read [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) at the repository root, then
[agents/README.md](../../agents/README.md).

Load the relevant canonical skill under `.agents/skills/<name>/SKILL.md` using
that router (`repo-verify`, `repo-bugfix`, `repo-refactor`).

This adapter introduces no independent policy.
